            'product_id' => '70',
            'name' => '1986 Argentina Home Retro Soccer Jersey Mexico World Cup Maradona',
            'description' => '&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;1986 Argentina Home Retro Soccer Jersey - Mexico \'86 Edition&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Own a piece of football history with the 1986 Argentina Home Retro Jersey. This iconic kit was worn during the legendary Mexico 1986 World Cup campaign, where Diego Maradona led the team to glory. From the &quot;Hand of God&quot; to the &quot;Goal of the Century,&quot; this jersey represents the pinnacle of Argentinian soccer. Featuring a classic V-neck and historical stripes, it is the ultimate tribute to a golden era.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Faithful modern remake of the 1986 World Cup home kit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Commemorating the legendary 1986 Mexico victory&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Classic sky blue and white stripes with vintage crest&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Soft, breathable high-performance polyester&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Historical V-neck design for authentic retro feel&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Perfect for collectors and fans of Diego Maradona&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;',
