            'description' => '&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;1978 Argentina Home Retro Soccer Jersey - World Cup Champions Edition&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Relive Argentina\'s first World Cup victory with this modern remake of the iconic 1978 Home Jersey. This was the kit worn by heroes as they won the tournament on home soil. Featuring the traditional sky blue and white stripes and a vintage-style crest, this jersey is crafted from premium breathable polyester for comfort. A must-have for every collector and fan of retro soccer history.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Authentic modern remake of the 1978 World Cup kit&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Traditional wide sky blue and white stripes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Vintage national team crest and V-neck design&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;100% premium breathable performance polyester&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Durable construction suitable for playing or casual wear&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Historical commemorative item for soccer fans&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;',
