            'name' => '2024 2025 River Plate Mens 30th Anniversary Home Soccer Jersey',
            'description' => '<p>Celebrate the 30-year anniversary of the legendary undefeated title win with the River Plate 2024/25 Home Jersey. Inspired by the historic 1994 kit, this jersey features red piping, a classic collar, and the iconic diagonal band. Engineered with modern moisture-managing technology and soft doubleknit fabric for elite comfort.</p><ul><li>30th Anniversary edition inspired by the 1994 kit</li><li>Iconic red diagonal band and piping details</li><li>Advanced moisture-managing performance technology</li><li>Embroidered River Plate crest and "Grandeza" sign-off</li><li>Lightweight 100% recycled material</li></ul>',
