            'description' => '&lt;p&gt;&lt;b&gt;1994 Argentina Away Retro Soccer Jersey - USA \'94 Edition&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celebrate a blast from the past with the 1994 Argentina Away Retro Jersey. This modern remake captures the bold blue design and iconic diamond pattern worn during the 1994 World Cup in the USA. A true statement piece for any fan of vintage soccer, this jersey combines an iconic look with modern comfort, making it perfect for both game days and casual street style.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Iconic 1994 World Cup away kit modern remake&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bold navy blue design with classic diamond side pattern&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Vintage-inspired polo collar and national crest&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;High-quality, breathable 100% performance polyester&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Durable construction with retro printing style&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Essential collector’s item for retro soccer enthusiasts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;',
            'meta_title' => '1994 Argentina Away Retro Soccer Jersey - USA \'94 Blue Diamond',
            'meta_description' => 'Make a statement with the 1994 Argentina Away Retro Jersey. Iconic blue diamond design from the USA World Cup. Premium vintage quality. Order yours now!',
